    Style     : Bold
    Skip      : Yes
    Width     : 28
    Inactive  : NOT ##HxcVcFetched OR NOT ##HxcVcHasBtnMaps

[Field: Hxc Vc F Btn Col Fld]
    Use       : Name Field
    Set as    : "Voucher field"
    Style     : Bold
    Skip      : Yes
    Width     : 28
    Inactive  : NOT ##HxcVcFetched OR NOT ##HxcVcHasBtnMaps

[Line: Hxc Vc F Btn Data]
